Now let me implement the adapter changes.

### Pucks

Add a research-derived constant:

```js
// Browser-researched shipping quote (2026-10-12, docs/evidence/browser-research/...).
// The public checkout estimator quoted a flat ₪30 home-delivery fee and free
// shipping over ₪100 for 1, 2 and 4 packs to Tel Aviv / 6100000 (the locality
// fields did not change the fee; the same free rule held for Eilat). The
// estimator exposes home delivery only. This is a cart quote, not a nationwide
// guarantee; it is stored with its condition and research timestamp.
const CHECKOUT_SHIPPING = {
  amountIls: 30,
  freeThresholdIls: 100,
  retrievedAt: '2026-10-12T18:10:10Z',
  sourceUrl: 'https://pucks.co.il/payment/request',
  note: 'Home-delivery fee quoted by the anonymous checkout estimator on 2026-10-12 (1, 2 and 4 × 250 g carts, Tel Aviv / 6100000): ₪30 flat, free above ₪100. The estimator offers home delivery only; no street address was entered.'
};
```

Then in the parser, set:
```js
shipping: {
  mode: 'delivery',
  certainty: 'verified',
  amount: { amount: CHECKOUT_SHIPPING.amountIls, currency: 'ILS' },
