  await waitFor(async () => evaluate(wd, `!document.getElementById('footer-status')?.textContent.includes('Waiting for the latest observation time')`), 20_000, 'home footer status');
}
```

Hmm, but there's a subtlety: if the fetch fails, footer says "Observation time is unavailable right now." — also not the placeholder, so the wait resolves and the check fails with the right message. Good.

