Let me reproduce quickly: run the production QA again and see whether the check passes this time. If it passes, it's flaky (race). Let me run it.

Actually, to save time, let me first implement the wait fix, then run the production QA again. The fix is correct regardless.

Also, maybe the home footer could be improved to avoid the placeholder flash: not necessary.

